{"4487540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wood'N'Destroy", "steam_appid": 4487540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wood’N’Destroy</strong> is an explosive real-time strategy game where you must <strong>build your base, manage your resources, and annihilate your enemies</strong> in intense tactical battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop wood, grow your economy, train your army, and prepare to <strong>destroy enemy bases before they destroy yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a fight for dominance: <strong>strategy, adaptation, and timing</strong> will make the difference between victory and destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your camp from nothing.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather essential resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct strategic buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your production to support your army</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strong economy is the key to surviving and dominating the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Command Your Army</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and lead different types of units to conquer your enemies.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee soldiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannons and ranged units</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy to every situation and exploit your opponents' weaknesses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Real-Time Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base with defensive structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch coordinated attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the terrain and key resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprise your enemies with unexpected strategies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The smartest players will prevail.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face opponents in different game modes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skirmishes against AI</strong> to test your strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom matches</strong> with your friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is different and offers new challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Explosive RTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wood’N’Destroy combines <strong>building, resource management, combat, and destruction</strong> in fast-paced strategic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build.<br>Expand.<br>Conquer.<br><strong>Destroy everything.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wood’N’Destroy</strong> is an explosive real-time strategy game where you must <strong>build your base, manage your resources, and annihilate your enemies</strong> in intense tactical battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop wood, grow your economy, train your army, and prepare to <strong>destroy enemy bases before they destroy yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a fight for dominance: <strong>strategy, adaptation, and timing</strong> will make the difference between victory and destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your camp from nothing.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather essential resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct strategic buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your production to support your army</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strong economy is the key to surviving and dominating the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Command Your Army</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and lead different types of units to conquer your enemies.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee soldiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannons and ranged units</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy to every situation and exploit your opponents' weaknesses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Real-Time Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base with defensive structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch coordinated attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the terrain and key resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprise your enemies with unexpected strategies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The smartest players will prevail.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face opponents in different game modes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skirmishes against AI</strong> to test your strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom matches</strong> with your friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is different and offers new challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Explosive RTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wood’N’Destroy combines <strong>building, resource management, combat, and destruction</strong> in fast-paced strategic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build.<br>Expand.<br>Conquer.<br><strong>Destroy everything.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Wood’N’Destroy is a real-time strategy game where you build your base, gather resources, and command your army to destroy your enemies. Expand your economy, develop new technologies, and dominate the battlefield.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487540/1c61f0379c2e77576645f532eb29761585696715/header.jpg?t=1774630800", "capsule_image": "https:/